<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-DORTMUND 5 STEAUA BUCHAREST 3 - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DORTMUND 5 STEAUA BUCHAREST 3 - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>DORTMUND, Germany 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Borussia Dortmund beat Steaua Bucharest 5-3 (halftime 3-1) in their European Champions' League group B match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Borussia Dortmund - Stephane Chapuisat 13, 22, Rene Tretschok 43, Karlheinz Riedle 62, Michael Zorc 64.</p>
<p>Steaua Bucharest - Sabin Ilie 17 pen, Marius Baciu 52, Aurel Calin 79.</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000.</p>
